Types Inferencing
=>hamai type define krny ki zrort ni prta,comipler type ko khud he smaj jata ha assigned value or code usage sy
=>Type inference in TypeScript is the compiler's smart ability to automatically figure out a variable's type (like string, number, boolean, array, object structure) from its assigned value or usage context

Examples:
let name = "Alice"; // Inferred as string
let count = 100;    // Inferred as number
let isActive = true; // Inferred as boolean
let mixed = [1, "hello"]; // Inferred as (string | number)[]
let person = { name: "Bob", age: 30 }; // Inferred as { name: string; age: number; }


Types annotations:
