 Type Narrowing & type Guards
 
 ===Type Narrowing
 Type Narrowing apko ye kehti ha k ap pta lgao k data kis type ka ha aur us ki basis pr ap data return kr skty hu.Jab ap upcoming data ki type ka pta kr lty hu tu ye us type k mutabiq apko methods suggest krna shuru kr dta ha,isy type narrowing kehty ha
 
 Techiques of type narrowing
 
 1)typeof checks
function printValue(value: string | number) {
  if (typeof value === "string") {
    console.log(value.toUpperCase()); // TypeScript knows 'value' is a string here,thats why it gives here a string methods
  } else {
    console.log(value.toFixed(2)); // TypeScript knows 'value' is a number here,thats why it gives here a number methods
  }
}

2)Truthy/Falsy checks:
function greet(name: string | undefined) {
  if (name) {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`); // 'name' is narrowed to string (not undefined)
  } else {
    console.log("No name provided."); // 'name' is undefined
  }
}

3)Exhaustive checks
function greet(order: "small" | "medium" |"large"|number) {
  if (order=="small") {
    return `ORDER SIZE, ${order}!`
  } else if (order=="medium"||order=="large") {
 return `ORDER SIZE, ${order}!`
  }else{
    return `ORDER SIZE, ${order}!`
  }
}

4)instanceof checks
function logValue(x: Date | string) {
  if (x instanceof Date) {
    console.log(x.toUTCString()); // 'x' is a Date
  } else {
    console.log(x.toUpperCase()); // 'x' is a string
  }
}


