Generics
Generics are the templates which make our code reusable .It is commonly used when you make libraries and frameworks.Also used in apis responses and react forms.
Generics means chezo ko general kro taky uski resueability increase hu jai

Example 1:
//<T> is generic symbol,
function WrapInArray<T>(item:T):T[]{    //upcoming data type and return type will also the same   
    return [item]
}
console.log(WrapInArray("masala"));
console.log(WrapInArray(78));
console.log(WrapInArray({id:1,name:"Tayyab"}));


Now by this example,we can see that we can easily pass any kind of data by using generics

Example 2:

function WrapInArray<A,B>(a:A,b:B):[A,B]{      
    return [a,b]
}
console.log(WrapInArray("masala",89));
console.log(WrapInArray(78,"meraa"));
console.log(WrapInArray({id:1,name:"Tayyab"},87));

Now here also we can send any kind of data

